<title>UK: Banco Santander unit sets $500 mln five-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Banco Santander unit sets $500 mln five-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue</p>
<p>was announced by lead manager Morgan Stanley</p>
<p> BORROWER   SANTANDER INTERNATIONAL LTD</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  BANCO SANTANDER SA</p>
<p> AMT	  $500 MLN  BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY	 AUG.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     ZERO	PAY DATE    14.AUG.97</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 ISS PRICE  100.074   FULL FEES   0.20</p>
